          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 10129,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1541585077,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "it is warning from Clang ANalyzer\n\n`\n| Logic error | Assigned value is garbage or undefined      | builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-thrift.c | dissect_thrift_common         | 2767 | 49 | View Report |\n|-------------|---------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|------|----|-------------|\n| Logic error | Result of operation is garbage or undefined | builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-thrift.c | dissect_thrift_binary_fields  | 1913 | 60 | View Report |\n| Logic error | Result of operation is garbage or undefined | builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-thrift.c | dissect_thrift_compact_fields | 2312 | 81 | View Report |`\n\nhttps://www.wireshark.org/download/automated/analysis/scan-build-2023-09-03-100153-3025-1/",
          "author": {
            "id": 279822,
            "username": "alagoutte",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Alexis La Goutte",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a15cba6417f4d1723eb56add7099bcfd8df373dc520577958b33c37915ef231b?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/alagoutte"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-09-04T09:39:22.418Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-09-04T09:39:22.418Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 213347832,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 10129,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1541766348,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "At first glance, it looks like Clang Analyzer does not see that field_id is set in `dissect_thrift_field_header()` in all paths that leads to this point.\n\nI’ll dig deeper into the subject to make sure I did not miss something (as well as the other 2) but would it be fine to simply set it to zero before the call to dissect_thrift_field_header to avoid the complaint?",
          "author": {
            "id": 7724340,
            "username": "EnigmaTriton",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Triton Circonflexe",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/7724340/avatar.png?v=1789776127",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/EnigmaTriton"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-09-04T11:18:33.007Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-09-04T11:18:44.418Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 213347832,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 10129,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1541987545,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, we can't (there is a Clang Analyzer check on CI for check)",
